<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>other half</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">lilbubblegum</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">other half</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2UFdflgt3v4nttlcpHJTtK</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.690" end="00:16.590">You know bruh?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.590" end="00:18.090">I really love this girl, but</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.800" end="00:20.590">I don't know if she loves me back bruh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.590" end="00:25.560">It's tough</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.560" end="00:27.640">Aye, aye</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.640" end="00:29.700">Aye, what's good?, what's up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.700" end="00:31.290">Keyshia Cole, girl, I'm in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.290" end="00:33.130">I know you the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.130" end="00:36.010">Make my heart beat like a drum, in the stu'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.010" end="00:38.260">I trust that you don't leave me on seen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.260" end="00:41.100">Said, "you perfect" and we started of as friends like Charlie Sheen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.100" end="00:44.180">Aye, what it do, yeah, I'm comin' through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.180" end="00:45.800">And my hunnids blue, got a Bentley coupe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:45.800" end="00:47.650">And I'm goin' zoom, straight to your room</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.650" end="00:49.200">Where your flowers bloom, I got one, got two</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.200" end="00:51.110">But I need a few and my love is due</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.110" end="00:52.800">Swear my hunnids grew, I'm in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.800" end="00:54.620">Infatuated and I need the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.620" end="00:56.430">You're my other half Selena to my Bruce</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.430" end="00:58.600">'K like, hey, wait, how was your day?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.600" end="01:00.240">Girl is you hungry?, I'll fix you a plate</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.240" end="01:01.850">Bae, what you really wanna do today?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.850" end="01:03.410">Let's kick it at home like Post Malone, wanna stay</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.410" end="01:05.320">Aye, girl you igniting my flame</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.320" end="01:07.220">Aye, you help me ease all the pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.220" end="01:08.850">Aye, changed my perspective</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.850" end="01:10.720">I used to be stressing that every girl was the same</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.720" end="01:12.360">But you proved me different</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.360" end="01:13.910">Now I'm on a mission to get to the bag</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.910" end="01:15.600">Need a new whip 'cause I'm going so fast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.600" end="01:17.450">And I might even crash so you better step back</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.450" end="01:19.280">I do not talk to these thots, I just tell me to stop</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:19.280" end="01:21.190">If they tell pull up, you know, I'm no the blast</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.190" end="01:22.690">I just want that cash, no cap</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.550" end="01:24.350">But this girl got me sad, I've been thinkin' 'bout plans</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.350" end="01:25.850">And I finally gotta say like</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.250" end="01:26.750">Aye, what's good?, what's up?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.540" end="01:28.040">Keyshia Cole, girl, I'm in love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.850" end="01:29.780">I know you the one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.780" end="01:32.750">Make my heart beat like a drum, in the stu'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.750" end="01:35.410">I trust that you don't leave me on seen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.410" end="01:38.670">Said, "you perfect" and we started of as friends like Charlie Sheen</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.670" end="01:40.720">Aye, what it do, yeah, I'm comin' through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.720" end="01:42.620">And my hunnids blue, got a Bentley coupe</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.620" end="01:44.540">And I'm goin' zoom, straight to your room</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.540" end="01:46.470">Where your flowers bloom, I got one, got two</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.470" end="01:48.080">But I need a few and my love is due</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.080" end="01:50.200">Swear my hunnids grew, I'm in love with you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.200" end="01:51.780">Infatuated and I need the truth</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.780" end="01:53.820">You're my other half Selena to my Bruce</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.820" end="01:57.820" /></div></body></tt>